rc=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3891134/002-1a0a168374.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3891134/003-e08856abad.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3891134/003-e08856abad.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n就是这样介绍PSS的！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3891134/004-5e57d195a9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3891134/004-5e57d195a9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还公布了好几只宝可梦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n而今年，2016年，\n\n游戏情报节目\n\n「Nintendo Treehouse: Live @ E3 2016」\n\n\n        这档节目\n\n将会播出！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n没想到！\n『宝可梦 太阳・月亮』\n『宝可梦 GO』\n\n\n\n将会\n\n在节目中亮相！\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n\n当然，\n\n增田我也预定出演！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n还会带来最新情报和开发秘闻！\n\n日本将通过Niconico直播\n\n进行转播！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n虽然因为时差\n\n是在深夜，\n\n但一定要看哦！\n\n记得关注！\n\n<br>\n・6月15日（星期三）凌晨1点起（日本时间）<br>\nNintendo Treehouse: Live @ E3 2016<br>\n『宝可梦 太阳・月亮』\n<br>\n节目页面：<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon.co.jp/redirect/index.php/3977/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://live.nicovideo.jp/gate/lv264394788</a>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3891134/005-7e30914b14.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3891134/005-7e30914b14.webp\" alt=\"別ウィンドウで開きます\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n・6月16日（星期四）凌晨2点起（日本时间）<br>\n宝可梦 GO开发者问答\n<br>\n节目页面：<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon.co.jp/redirect/index.php/3978/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://live.nicovideo.jp/gate/lv264395696</a>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/imag